    "@value" : "PBM type value used with prov:type in PROV-N/PROV-JSON/PROV-XML (prov:type='pbm:acquisition'). Declared as a class equivalent to pbm:Acquisition so that the rdf:type triple produced from prov:type by the PROV-O mapping is classified as pbm:Acquisition."
  } ],
